@Service
public class PlanService {
    @Transactional
    public PlanView publish(PublishPlanRequest req) {
        GroupRow group = groupRepo.findGroupById(req.groupId()).orElseThrow(notFound);
        List<OutletRow> outlets = groupRepo.findOutletsByGroupId(groupId); // sorted by code
        if empty → badRequest
        // carryover from round-1 settlement
        Map<Long,Long> carry = settlementRepo.findCarryoverByGroupAndRound(groupId, roundNo-1); // if roundNo>0
        // compute allocation
        List<Allocation> allocs = AllocationCalculator.allocateByArea(total, weighted);
        // details: base + carry
        // fingerprint
        String fp = fingerprint(req, details);
        // idempotency
        Optional<PlanVersionRow> existing = planRepo.findVersionByRequestId(req.requestId());
        if (existing.present) {
            if (existing.fingerprint.equals(fp)) return toView(existing, replayed=true);
            throw conflict("相同 requestId 的计划参数不一致");
        }
        // sealed check
        if (settlementRepo.findByGroupAndRound(groupId, roundNo).isPresent()) throw conflict("轮次已封存");
        int versionNo = planRepo.findMaxVersionNo + 1;
        long versionId = planRepo.insertVersion(..., "EFFECTIVE");
        insert details;
        // pointer
        Optional<Long> pointer = planRepo.findEffectivePlanVersionId(groupId, roundNo);
        if (pointer.isEmpty()) {
            try { planRepo.insertEffectivePointer(...); }
            catch (DuplicateKeyException e) { throw conflict("并发发布冲突，仅一个版本可生效"); }
        } else {
            int updated = planRepo.updateEffectivePointer(groupId, roundNo, versionId, pointer.get());
            if (updated == 0) throw conflict("并发发布冲突，仅一个版本可生效");
            planRepo.updateVersionStatus(pointer.get(), "SUPERSEDED");
        }
        return view(replayed=false);
    }
}
```

Wait: conflict thrown inside @Transactional → rollback → version insert rolled back. Good.

Fingerprint: sha256 hex of canonical string. Canonical: requestId|groupId|roundNo|code:base:carry:planned,code2:... (sorted by code — outlets already sorted by code).

Round dates: roundStart = LocalDate.ofEpochDay(roundNo * 7L), roundEnd = roundStart.plusDays(7).

toView(row, replayed): load details.

listVersions(groupId, roundNo) → List<PlanView> (replayed=false).
